Celebrate [[Million Downloads Event/88.88 Million|8,880,000 worldwide downloads]] by welcoming victorious Outcat TRASH CAT to The Battle Cats with a special campaign between April 22, 2024 (11:00AM) until May 6, 2024 (10:59AM)!

